{"slug": "C_S03E12", "video_name": "Community - S03E12 - Contemporary Impressionists Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S03E12 - Contemporary Impressionists Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1282.949, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 472, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.450819672131148, "text": "Happy New Year, you guys."}, {"start": 5.450819672131148, "end": 9.936065573770492, "text": "Do you want anything"}, {"start": 9.936065573770492, "end": 13.3, "text": "fun over break?"}, {"start": 13.3, "end": 16.0, "text": "Oh, baby, baby got to be baby Jesus in our church's activity play."}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 18.136363636363637, "text": "And Andre was Joseph, and Jordan was one of the"}, {"start": 18.136363636363637, "end": 20.0, "text": "wise men, and I was in charge of casting."}, {"start": 20.0, "end": 22.46315789473684, "text": "I digitized my entire movie collection."}, {"start": 22.46315789473684, "end": 23.28421052631579, "text": "Goodbye, VHS."}, {"start": 23.28421052631579, "end": 26.0, "text": "Hello, select Division C, E, D, Video Disc."}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 30.9875, "text": "I'm very psyched for the new semester, or should I say..."}, {"start": 30.9875, "end": 33.0, "text": "intro to human psyched?"}, {"start": 33.0, "end": 38.0, "text": "For midterm, we actually get to diagnose a fellow student with something."}, {"start": 38.0, "end": 40.24, "text": "Don't you do way too much of that already?"}, {"start": 40.24, "end": 42.0, "text": "Accusational opposition disorder."}, {"start": 42.0, "end": 42.433734939759034, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 42.433734939759034, "end": 47.06024096385542, "text": "It appears you've all noticed that my swagger has a new swagger."}, {"start": 47.06024096385542, "end": 48.0, "text": "I'll explain."}, {"start": 48.0, "end": 51.0, "text": "Over break, I took the plunge and started seeing a new shrink."}, {"start": 51.0, "end": 51.90909090909091, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 51.90909090909091, "end": 53.0, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 53.0, "end": 53.33644859813084, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 53.33644859813084, "end": 56.252336448598136, "text": "Anyway, I talked about my dad punched a few pillows,"}, {"start": 56.252336448598136, "end": 59.0, "text": "and she put me on this amazing anti-anxiety pill."}, {"start": 59.0, "end": 61.89855072463768, "text": "It's really enhanced my self-confidence."}, {"start": 61.89855072463768, "end": 64.0, "text": "I explained that really well."}, {"start": 64.0, "end": 66.37288135593221, "text": "Jeff, you can't be on anti-anxiety meds."}, {"start": 66.37288135593221, "end": 71.0, "text": "What little self-doubt you have is the only thing keeping your ego pen to end."}, {"start": 71.0, "end": 73.0, "text": "You are a textbook narcissist."}, {"start": 73.0, "end": 75.0, "text": "I'm an exceptional narcissist, Broda."}, {"start": 75.0, "end": 76.94444444444444, "text": "Oh, excuse me."}, {"start": 76.94444444444444, "end": 80.0, "text": "I didn't kill my wife."}, {"start": 80.0, "end": 83.0, "text": "I don't care."}, {"start": 89.0, "end": 91.0, "text": "Stop that fugitive!"}, {"start": 91.0, "end": 94.0, "text": "I was wondering how long it would take for things to get back to normal."}, {"start": 94.0, "end": 97.05825242718447, "text": "Over break, Abed realized he could hire celebrity impersonators"}, {"start": 97.05825242718447, "end": 99.0, "text": "from a service for his own personal use."}, {"start": 99.0, "end": 100.55555555555556, "text": "He's been doing it..."}, {"start": 100.55555555555556, "end": 101.0, "text": "a lot."}, {"start": 101.0, "end": 102.03092783505154, "text": "He's not hurting anybody."}, {"start": 102.03092783505154, "end": 103.84536082474226, "text": "He just likes reenacting scenes from movies."}, {"start": 103.84536082474226, "end": 105.0, "text": "It's unquestionably awesome."}, {"start": 105.0, "end": 105.6086956521739, "text": "I question it."}, {"start": 105.6086956521739, "end": 109.0, "text": "He spent New Year's locked in our bathroom with a bad Tom Hanks from Castaway."}, {"start": 109.0, "end": 110.0, "text": "I bet it was the volleyball."}, {"start": 110.0, "end": 111.0, "text": "Well, that makes sense."}, {"start": 111.0, "end": 111.82758620689656, "text": "You guys, focus!"}, {"start": 111.82758620689656, "end": 114.0, "text": "Where's he getting the money for all this?"}, {"start": 114.0, "end": 114.66666666666667, "text": "Intervention?"}, {"start": 114.66666666666667, "end": 115.33333333333334, "text": "Intervention?"}, {"start": 115.33333333333334, "end": 116.0, "text": "Intervention?"}, {"start": 116.0, "end": 116.13636363636364, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 116.13636363636364, "end": 117.68181818181819, "text": "You guys need to stop intervening."}, {"start": 117.68181818181819, "end": 119.0, "text": "You seriously have a problem."}, {"start": 119.0, "end": 120.8125, "text": "I said I didn't kill my wife!"}, {"start": 120.8125, "end": 122.0, "text": "I still don't care!"}, {"start": 122.0, "end": 123.0, "text": "Freeze!"}, {"start": 123.0, "end": 125.0, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 125.0, "end": 127.0, "text": "Jay, they're just acting!"}, {"start": 127.0, "end": 129.0, "text": "Oh, sorry."}, {"start": 129.0, "end": 130.0, "text": "What was that?"}, {"start": 130.0, "end": 131.0, "text": "Somebody call the cops!"}, {"start": 131.0, "end": 133.0, "text": "I got a friend at the zoo."}, {"start": 139.0, "end": 161.0, "text": "[music]"}, {"start": 161.0, "end": 164.0, "text": "What is this idea about a tranquilizer gun?"}, {"start": 164.0, "end": 167.0, "text": "If you had hit a small student, they could have died!"}, {"start": 167.0, "end": 168.05555555555554, "text": "I wouldn't do that!"}, {"start": 168.05555555555554, "end": 170.0, "text": "I have a heavy flashlight for them!"}, {"start": 170.0, "end": 171.0, "text": "Oh, Ben!"}, {"start": 171.0, "end": 174.46774193548387, "text": "Look, I have to resort to extreme measures."}, {"start": 174.46774193548387, "end": 176.0, "text": "I'm a one-man army."}, {"start": 176.0, "end": 178.0, "text": "You won't let me have any guards."}, {"start": 178.0, "end": 179.21428571428572, "text": "We're broke, Ben!"}, {"start": 179.21428571428572, "end": 185.0, "text": "We now get 80% of our electricity from that apartment building across the street!"}, {"start": 185.0, "end": 185.3846153846154, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 185.3846153846154, "end": 190.0, "text": "I don't know who told you pouting was an option for you, but"}, {"start": 190.0, "end": 195.0, "text": "all you're making me feel right now is hatred of Renee Zellweger."}, {"start": 195.0, "end": 199.0, "text": "Look, maybe you can bring on some students as security interns."}, {"start": 199.0, "end": 203.0, "text": "I'll let you offer them a credit in safety or math or something."}, {"start": 203.0, "end": 204.0, "text": "Thank you, sir."}, {"start": 204.0, "end": 207.0, "text": "You won't regret this unless I rise up against you."}, {"start": 207.0, "end": 209.0, "text": "I don't know why I said that."}, {"start": 209.0, "end": 210.0, "text": "Bye!"}, {"start": 219.0, "end": 219.54054054054055, "text": "Jeff!"}, {"start": 219.54054054054055, "end": 220.0810810810811, "text": "Jeff!"}, {"start": 220.0810810810811, "end": 221.7027027027027, "text": "I looked it up."}, {"start": 221.7027027027027, "end": 223.0, "text": "I was right."}, {"start": 223.0, "end": 224.7, "text": "Oh, that thing about Danny Thomas?"}, {"start": 224.7, "end": 225.7, "text": "I looked it up, too."}, {"start": 225.7, "end": 226.0, "text": "Weird."}, {"start": 226.0, "end": 226.16153846153847, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 226.16153846153847, "end": 229.44615384615386, "text": "Those meds you're taking, without anxiety to keep your vanity"}, {"start": 229.44615384615386, "end": 233.0, "text": "in check, you are vulnerable to a syndrome called hypernursicosis."}, {"start": 233.0, "end": 233.97058823529412, "text": "Okay, look."}, {"start": 233.97058823529412, "end": 236.0, "text": "This apple is your ego."}, {"start": 236.0, "end": 239.74193548387098, "text": "Imagine it expanding to the point of critical mass, taking"}, {"start": 239.74193548387098, "end": 244.0, "text": "over your whole personality, making you an uncontrollable monster."}, {"start": 244.0, "end": 246.1578947368421, "text": "Britta, how did an apple make that clear?"}, {"start": 246.1578947368421, "end": 247.26315789473685, "text": "Imagine it expanding?"}, {"start": 247.26315789473685, "end": 248.0, "text": "Use a balloon."}, {"start": 248.0, "end": 249.0, "text": "I was on my way to lunch."}, {"start": 249.0, "end": 250.92857142857142, "text": "Why are you trying to take this away from me?"}, {"start": 250.92857142857142, "end": 252.0, "text": "I like having no anxiety."}, {"start": 252.0, "end": 254.0, "text": "I'm in harmony with the world."}, {"start": 254.0, "end": 255.0, "text": "Looking good, winger."}, {"start": 255.0, "end": 259.0, "text": "Thank you, Leonard, for that compliment and for your service to this country."}, {"start": 259.0, "end": 263.0, "text": "I'm so confident now I can pull things off I never dreamed possible."}, {"start": 263.0, "end": 268.0, "text": "Look, aviators, final boarding called Beefcake Airways."}, {"start": 268.0, "end": 270.82828282828285, "text": "I'm warning you as your friend to get off of those meds,"}, {"start": 270.82828282828285, "end": 274.61616161616166, "text": "and until they're out of your system, stay away from flattering situations,"}, {"start": 274.61616161616166, "end": 278.0, "text": "weddings, soft lighting, formal wear, gay bars, and take those off."}, {"start": 278.0, "end": 280.0, "text": "Because they make me look good."}, {"start": 280.0, "end": 282.0, "text": "That's not relevant."}, {"start": 282.0, "end": 283.0, "text": "Welcome back, Jeffrey."}, {"start": 283.0, "end": 284.0, "text": "How was your..."}, {"start": 286.0, "end": 288.3478260869565, "text": "Oh my God, even his shadow."}, {"start": 288.3478260869565, "end": 290.0, "text": "Look at his shadow!"}, {"start": 296.0, "end": 298.78846153846155, "text": "Security intership available."}, {"start": 298.78846153846155, "end": 301.0, "text": "Come on, see the world."}, {"start": 301.0, "end": 303.0, "text": "I mean, you won't see the world, but come on!"}, {"start": 305.0, "end": 306.0, "text": "Hey, my dear."}, {"start": 306.0, "end": 307.0, "text": "Oh, hey, Vinny."}, {"start": 307.0, "end": 310.0, "text": "Vinny's the owner of the doppelganger, the celebrity impersonator service I use."}, {"start": 310.0, "end": 311.0, "text": "You look familiar."}, {"start": 311.0, "end": 313.0, "text": "That's how we all get started in this racket."}, {"start": 313.0, "end": 316.0162601626016, "text": "But, at a certain point, you're smart, you move up to"}, {"start": 316.0162601626016, "end": 320.0, "text": "management before the gold mine of resembling French Stewart runs dry."}, {"start": 321.0, "end": 324.0, "text": "And speaking of gold mines, you owe me three grand, pal."}, {"start": 324.0, "end": 326.0, "text": "Cool, put it on my account."}, {"start": 326.0, "end": 327.0, "text": "What do I look like, a sucker?"}, {"start": 327.0, "end": 329.0, "text": "French Stewart, but I don't have three grand."}, {"start": 329.0, "end": 329.69767441860466, "text": "Well, you know what?"}, {"start": 329.69767441860466, "end": 332.0, "text": "You better get it, because I'm gonna tell you something right now."}, {"start": 332.0, "end": 334.0, "text": "Holy crap, you'd make an amazing sea crest."}, {"start": 334.0, "end": 336.0, "text": "Very kind, thank you."}, {"start": 336.0, "end": 338.0, "text": "You're actually a lot taller than sea crest."}, {"start": 338.0, "end": 341.0, "text": "You've actually got a sharper jaw, too."}, {"start": 341.0, "end": 344.0, "text": "You're actually more handsome than the guy that's famous for being handsome."}, {"start": 344.0, "end": 345.0, "text": "Jeff?"}, {"start": 350.0, "end": 351.875, "text": "You'll be okay."}, {"start": 351.875, "end": 354.0, "text": "Just stay humble."}, {"start": 355.0, "end": 355.54901960784315, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 355.54901960784315, "end": 357.0, "text": "Maybe there's another option for you."}, {"start": 357.0, "end": 360.0, "text": "I got a big event Saturday, needs a lot of bodies, huh?"}, {"start": 360.0, "end": 363.0, "text": "And I see some high-value faces here."}, {"start": 363.0, "end": 368.0, "text": "Got an Oprah, and sitting next to her is Judy Garland or Anne Hathaway."}, {"start": 368.0, "end": 369.0, "text": "Had a few extra teeth."}, {"start": 369.0, "end": 373.0, "text": "Wow, this is rare, both versions of Michael Jackson."}, {"start": 374.0, "end": 375.0, "text": "And you?"}, {"start": 375.0, "end": 376.0, "text": "Pat Brando."}, {"start": 376.0, "end": 377.0, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 377.0, "end": 378.0, "text": "Pat Brando."}, {"start": 378.0, "end": 379.0, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 379.0, "end": 384.0, "text": "Look, if you guys work this gig for me, for six hours, we'll call it even."}, {"start": 384.0, "end": 385.0, "text": "Sounds fun."}, {"start": 385.0, "end": 387.0, "text": "Abed, Vinny, can we have a minute to talk about this?"}, {"start": 387.0, "end": 387.25, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 387.25, "end": 388.0, "text": "Come on, Vinny."}, {"start": 388.0, "end": 390.0, "text": "The guy who makes the fish sticks looks just like Quincy Jones."}, {"start": 390.0, "end": 391.0, "text": "Get out."}, {"start": 391.0, "end": 393.0, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 393.0, "end": 395.0, "text": "Guys, I'm sorry, but this is where we have to put our foot down."}, {"start": 395.0, "end": 396.0, "text": "Well, she has a point."}, {"start": 396.0, "end": 398.3619047619048, "text": "Next time, it'll be $10,000 and then $20,000, and then they'll"}, {"start": 398.3619047619048, "end": 400.0, "text": "hit rock bottom and have no one to turn to."}, {"start": 400.0, "end": 402.0, "text": "But Jesus, I say we let this play out."}, {"start": 402.0, "end": 404.5806451612903, "text": "I'd love to help, but playing Ryan Seacrest at a"}, {"start": 404.5806451612903, "end": 407.0, "text": "big party may not be a safe situation for me."}, {"start": 407.0, "end": 410.196261682243, "text": "We can actually hurt Abed if every time he faces reality,"}, {"start": 410.196261682243, "end": 413.0, "text": "we dress up and play make-believe to bail him out."}, {"start": 413.0, "end": 415.0, "text": "Shame on you people."}, {"start": 415.0, "end": 417.375, "text": "It's not our job to help Abed grow up."}, {"start": 417.375, "end": 419.0, "text": "Abed doesn't need reality."}, {"start": 419.0, "end": 424.0, "text": "Abed is a magical elf-like man who makes us all more magical by being near us."}, {"start": 424.0, "end": 427.0, "text": "Pierce, who came over in the middle of the night that time you forgot how to fart?"}, {"start": 427.0, "end": 428.0, "text": "Amen."}, {"start": 428.0, "end": 432.0, "text": "Shirley, who got you a DVD of Precious Based on the Novel Push by Sapphire"}, {"start": 432.0, "end": 435.0, "text": "and a copy of the novel Push autographed by Sapphire?"}, {"start": 435.0, "end": 436.0, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 436.0, "end": 438.0, "text": "All we had was dumb reality before we met that man."}, {"start": 438.0, "end": 441.0, "text": "And he's made all of our lives better than reality."}, {"start": 441.0, "end": 444.0, "text": "Now it becomes a little inconvenient and it's time to get real?"}, {"start": 444.0, "end": 447.0, "text": "For shame."}, {"start": 447.0, "end": 448.4347826086956, "text": "He's right."}, {"start": 448.4347826086956, "end": 450.0, "text": "Sorry, Troy."}, {"start": 450.0, "end": 451.0, "text": "Hey, guys."}, {"start": 451.0, "end": 452.9672131147541, "text": "Abed, we would be happy to help you out."}, {"start": 452.9672131147541, "end": 454.0, "text": "It'll be a good time."}, {"start": 454.0, "end": 454.5, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 454.5, "end": 456.0, "text": "Yeah, go, cool."}, {"start": 456.0, "end": 456.45454545454544, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 456.45454545454544, "end": 457.0, "text": "Oprah."}, {"start": 457.0, "end": 458.0, "text": "Oh, thank you."}, {"start": 458.0, "end": 459.0, "text": "See you, baby."}, {"start": 459.0, "end": 460.0, "text": "Hi, Brando."}, {"start": 460.0, "end": 461.0, "text": "It's Bert Road."}, {"start": 461.0, "end": 463.0, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 463.0, "end": 464.2682926829268, "text": "Thanks for being flexible."}, {"start": 464.2682926829268, "end": 465.0, "text": "This'll be fun."}, {"start": 465.0, "end": 465.8888888888889, "text": "Fun, yeah, sure."}, {"start": 465.8888888888889, "end": 467.0, "text": "But here's the deal."}, {"start": 467.0, "end": 469.6823529411765, "text": "Um, if you guys mess this up, then his"}, {"start": 469.6823529411765, "end": 473.0, "text": "debt is overdue, and I don't send another bill."}, {"start": 473.0, "end": 478.0, "text": "No, I send two guys that look a lot like Ving Rhames and Michael Chiklis,"}, {"start": 478.0, "end": 483.0, "text": "and they do a very convincing impression of breaking your friend's legs."}, {"start": 483.0, "end": 487.0, "text": "Their secret is they actually break them."}, {"start": 495.0, "end": 499.0, "text": "All right, impersonators, our guest of honor is one Howie Schwartz,"}, {"start": 499.0, "end": 501.0, "text": "who, according to the Talmud, just became a man."}, {"start": 501.0, "end": 505.0, "text": "But I have to say, I wouldn't want him next to me in a foxhole."}, {"start": 505.0, "end": 506.0, "text": "Ground rules."}, {"start": 506.0, "end": 510.0, "text": "Do stay in your assigned quadrants, quoting lines from movies you are positive"}, {"start": 510.0, "end": 512.0, "text": "that your impersonate he was in."}, {"start": 512.0, "end": 517.0, "text": "Do not leave your quadrant burp, fart, cough, hiccup, or cuss."}, {"start": 517.0, "end": 520.0, "text": "The obvious exception being James, our resident wolf, your map owl."}, {"start": 520.0, "end": 521.0, "text": "How you doing, Jimmy?"}, {"start": 521.0, "end": 523.0, "text": "Oh, you give him help."}, {"start": 523.0, "end": 524.0, "text": "All right, let's go."}, {"start": 524.0, "end": 526.0, "text": "My life, my hands, the fight."}, {"start": 526.0, "end": 528.0, "text": "I'm ready to tango."}, {"start": 528.0, "end": 528.9047619047619, "text": "Handsome sea crest."}, {"start": 528.9047619047619, "end": 530.0, "text": "I need you in this tux."}, {"start": 530.0, "end": 532.0, "text": "Jeff, do not wear that."}, {"start": 532.0, "end": 534.0, "text": "I'll step it wide, Jacko."}, {"start": 534.0, "end": 535.0, "text": "Don't worry."}, {"start": 535.0, "end": 537.0, "text": "That thing in the cafeteria freaked me out,"}, {"start": 537.0, "end": 539.0, "text": "so I talked to my shrink and she doubled my dosage."}, {"start": 539.0, "end": 539.4, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 539.4, "end": 541.0, "text": "Jeff, that's insane."}, {"start": 541.0, "end": 545.0, "text": "I thought so too, but after I took that extra pill, it seemed like a great idea."}, {"start": 545.0, "end": 546.6842105263158, "text": "Jeff, put it on."}, {"start": 546.6842105263158, "end": 547.0, "text": "Go."}, {"start": 547.0, "end": 548.0, "text": "No, Jeff."}, {"start": 548.0, "end": 549.0, "text": "Britta, stop arguing."}, {"start": 549.0, "end": 550.2613636363636, "text": "If you have anything else to say, say"}, {"start": 550.2613636363636, "end": 552.0, "text": "it in a high-pitched voice while walking backwards."}, {"start": 552.0, "end": 554.0, "text": "Jeff is in grave danger."}, {"start": 558.0, "end": 560.0, "text": "Uh, may I help you?"}, {"start": 560.0, "end": 562.0, "text": "I'm one of the impersonators."}, {"start": 562.0, "end": 564.0, "text": "Which one?"}, {"start": 564.0, "end": 566.0, "text": "Do I have to say it?"}, {"start": 566.0, "end": 568.0, "text": "Burt Reynolds?"}, {"start": 568.0, "end": 568.375, "text": "Uh, yeah."}, {"start": 568.375, "end": 571.0, "text": "I don't believe anybody hired you to impersonate Burt Reynolds."}, {"start": 571.0, "end": 572.0, "text": "Why not?"}, {"start": 572.0, "end": 574.0, "text": "Do I have to say it?"}, {"start": 586.0, "end": 588.0, "text": "May I help you?"}, {"start": 588.0, "end": 590.0, "text": "I'm Brando."}, {"start": 590.0, "end": 592.0, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 592.0, "end": 594.0, "text": "Could be under fat."}, {"start": 594.0, "end": 595.0, "text": "Ah."}, {"start": 595.0, "end": 596.0, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 596.0, "end": 596.9411764705883, "text": "Totally."}, {"start": 596.9411764705883, "end": 598.0, "text": "Go on in."}, {"start": 602.0, "end": 604.0, "text": "Abbot, get back to your station."}, {"start": 604.0, "end": 604.8181818181819, "text": "I can't right now."}, {"start": 604.8181818181819, "end": 606.0, "text": "I'm talking to Gina Davis."}, {"start": 606.0, "end": 608.0, "text": "Abbot, we have to do this right, or Vinnie won't clear your debt."}, {"start": 608.0, "end": 610.0, "text": "Troy, who cares about money?"}, {"start": 610.0, "end": 610.6666666666666, "text": "Look around."}, {"start": 610.6666666666666, "end": 612.0, "text": "This is why we're alive."}, {"start": 612.0, "end": 613.4545454545455, "text": "Ooh, fake Lorenzo Lamas."}, {"start": 613.4545454545455, "end": 614.0, "text": "Let's go."}, {"start": 614.0, "end": 616.0, "text": "You're so sad to hear of your piss."}, {"start": 618.0, "end": 620.0, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 620.0, "end": 622.0, "text": "Sergeant Chang, what are you doing here?"}, {"start": 622.0, "end": 624.0, "text": "Hey, Annie."}, {"start": 624.0, "end": 626.0, "text": "Ah, just one of the perks when your brother's a rabbi."}, {"start": 626.0, "end": 629.0, "text": "He throws me some private security gigs at the events he officiates."}, {"start": 629.0, "end": 632.0, "text": "They can get really intense sometimes."}, {"start": 632.0, "end": 635.0, "text": "Maybe some jerk brought a scalpel to a bris."}, {"start": 635.0, "end": 637.0, "text": "Now smile."}, {"start": 638.0, "end": 640.0, "text": "Why is he out of his quadrant?"}, {"start": 641.52, "end": 643.0302127659575, "text": "- I'm Lorenzo Halvis."}, {"start": 643.0302127659575, "end": 644.9, "text": "- He's reenacting a movie."}, {"start": 644.9, "end": 645.262, "text": "Please."}, {"start": 645.262, "end": 648.52, "text": "What movie were Jamie Lee Curtis and Lorenzo Lamas in together?"}, {"start": 648.52, "end": 652.62, "text": "See, now I'm just embarrassed for you, because you've never seen Lorenzo's oil."}, {"start": 652.62, "end": 654.9, "text": "Lorenzo is an oil tycoon that gets his"}, {"start": 654.9, "end": 657.66, "text": "address book switched with Jamie Lee Curtis's."}, {"start": 657.66, "end": 660.54, "text": "And they give each other piggy-back rides."}, {"start": 660.54, "end": 661.9117073170731, "text": "I can't believe it."}, {"start": 661.9117073170731, "end": 663.5, "text": "Did you go to college?"}, {"start": 663.5, "end": 664.0333333333333, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 664.0333333333333, "end": 665.7666666666667, "text": "No, whatever."}, {"start": 665.7666666666667, "end": 667.5, "text": "Keep working."}, {"start": 671.52, "end": 674.3721428571429, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 674.3721428571429, "end": 678.78, "text": "You are gorgeous."}, {"start": 678.78, "end": 680.1606896551724, "text": "Will you look at this one?"}, {"start": 680.1606896551724, "end": 681.86, "text": "He's like a Robert Redford, huh?"}, {"start": 681.86, "end": 682.3354166666667, "text": "No, no."}, {"start": 682.3354166666667, "end": 685.12, "text": "More like a taller, hotter Ryan Seacrest."}, {"start": 685.12, "end": 687.5510344827586, "text": "It's amazing you're actually more handsome than"}, {"start": 687.5510344827586, "end": 689.62, "text": "the guy who's famous for being handsome."}, {"start": 695.62, "end": 697.2301818181818, "text": "Skullcracker 2000."}, {"start": 697.2301818181818, "end": 698.6614545454545, "text": "Top of the line."}, {"start": 698.6614545454545, "end": 700.54, "text": "Who wants to hold it?"}, {"start": 700.54, "end": 701.00875, "text": "- Me!"}, {"start": 701.00875, "end": 702.415, "text": "That's so cool."}, {"start": 702.415, "end": 703.54, "text": "- Little me."}, {"start": 703.54, "end": 704.3910638297872, "text": "- Awesome."}, {"start": 704.3910638297872, "end": 706.2634042553191, "text": "Dude, this is so sick."}, {"start": 706.2634042553191, "end": 707.54, "text": "Check this out."}, {"start": 711.54, "end": 714.54, "text": "Any fine young men interested in a college credit?"}, {"start": 714.54, "end": 715.4733333333332, "text": "- Sure."}, {"start": 715.4733333333332, "end": 716.54, "text": "- Right."}, {"start": 722.54, "end": 724.6999999999999, "text": "Look, man, if you have a request, not a real DJ, okay?"}, {"start": 724.6999999999999, "end": 725.54, "text": "These are just props."}, {"start": 725.54, "end": 727.2622222222221, "text": "You look like a friend of mine."}, {"start": 727.2622222222221, "end": 728.54, "text": "Your friends with Moby?"}, {"start": 731.54, "end": 733.54, "text": "Yes!"}, {"start": 744.54, "end": 748.54, "text": "I haven't been dipped like that since my last divorce."}, {"start": 748.54, "end": 749.8525, "text": "Britta, you're right."}, {"start": 749.8525, "end": 751.7275, "text": "I can feel my ego taking over."}, {"start": 751.7275, "end": 752.54, "text": "Do something!"}, {"start": 752.54, "end": 753.6576470588235, "text": "Okay, listen to me."}, {"start": 753.6576470588235, "end": 755.4811764705883, "text": "You are not that big of a deal."}, {"start": 755.4811764705883, "end": 756.54, "text": "Do you understand?"}, {"start": 756.54, "end": 757.8362962962963, "text": "You have bad posture."}, {"start": 757.8362962962963, "end": 761.54, "text": "When you do too many push-ups, it looks like you have boobs."}, {"start": 761.54, "end": 763.457808219178, "text": "The tile in your bathroom is tacky."}, {"start": 763.457808219178, "end": 765.54, "text": "You were emotionally closed off in bed"}, {"start": 765.54, "end": 767.3826966292135, "text": "to the point where one time I didn't come"}, {"start": 767.3826966292135, "end": 769.54, "text": "up because I couldn't find close enough parking."}, {"start": 769.54, "end": 773.54, "text": "You have an unusually high butt-crack."}, {"start": 773.54, "end": 774.1851612903225, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 774.1851612903225, "end": 777.54, "text": "It couldn't have been easy for you to lie like that."}, {"start": 777.54, "end": 779.54, "text": "We are getting you out of here."}, {"start": 779.54, "end": 781.6715789473684, "text": "Get back to your quadrants."}, {"start": 781.6715789473684, "end": 781.9873684210526, "text": "Now!"}, {"start": 781.9873684210526, "end": 782.54, "text": "Britta!"}, {"start": 782.54, "end": 785.3821052631579, "text": "Honey, you were the highlight of the evening."}, {"start": 785.3821052631579, "end": 788.54, "text": "If you walked to me, you'd win every single award."}, {"start": 789.54, "end": 791.54, "text": "There's awards?"}, {"start": 795.54, "end": 800.54, "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to Howie Schwartz's Star Mix with Awards."}, {"start": 800.54, "end": 805.54, "text": "Here to present the first award are fake Morgan Freeman and fake Bono."}, {"start": 805.54, "end": 806.49, "text": "You know fake Bono."}, {"start": 806.49, "end": 807.54, "text": "Algebra can be tough."}, {"start": 807.54, "end": 810.6225688073395, "text": "They sure can fake Morgan Freeman and that's why it's so"}, {"start": 810.6225688073395, "end": 813.54, "text": "important to reward those to whom it comes so easily."}, {"start": 813.54, "end": 819.54, "text": "The winner for our best math student is Howie Schwartz."}, {"start": 825.54, "end": 827.54, "text": "Wow, these things are heavy."}, {"start": 828.54, "end": 832.54, "text": "The award for cleanest room goes to Howie Schwartz."}, {"start": 833.54, "end": 837.54, "text": "Coolest skateboard tricks, Howie Schwartz."}, {"start": 837.54, "end": 841.54, "text": "Best Halo score, Howie Schwartz."}, {"start": 843.54, "end": 845.3495238095238, "text": "If you ask me, I think you're going to"}, {"start": 845.3495238095238, "end": 847.54, "text": "win the award for the most handsome young man."}, {"start": 847.54, "end": 849.54, "text": "Nah, give me a break."}, {"start": 849.54, "end": 851.54, "text": "It's his bar mitzvah."}, {"start": 851.54, "end": 853.54, "text": "Jack, I think that we should go."}, {"start": 853.54, "end": 856.54, "text": "There's an award for most handsome young man."}, {"start": 856.54, "end": 857.490495049505, "text": "Hello, everyone."}, {"start": 857.490495049505, "end": 859.6291089108911, "text": "It is my honor and privilege as fake"}, {"start": 859.6291089108911, "end": 862.54, "text": "Oprah Winfrey to present the night's final award."}, {"start": 862.54, "end": 865.54, "text": "Most handsome young man."}, {"start": 865.54, "end": 867.54, "text": "And the winner is..."}, {"start": 869.54, "end": 873.54, "text": "Howie Schwartz!"}, {"start": 893.54, "end": 895.54, "text": "Look at me!"}, {"start": 895.54, "end": 897.54, "text": "Look at me!"}, {"start": 901.54, "end": 903.54, "text": "Oh, God, no!"}, {"start": 903.54, "end": 904.54, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 904.54, "end": 906.4066666666666, "text": "You wanted it."}, {"start": 906.4066666666666, "end": 908.54, "text": "You all want it!"}, {"start": 923.54, "end": 925.54, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 933.54, "end": 934.6066666666667, "text": "I love you, Dad."}, {"start": 934.6066666666667, "end": 936.54, "text": "I knew you'd invite the Hulk."}, {"start": 943.54, "end": 944.446976744186, "text": "You're lucky."}, {"start": 944.446976744186, "end": 946.54, "text": "And your friend's dad is paid."}, {"start": 946.54, "end": 949.54, "text": "Hey, Jimmy, wait up."}, {"start": 952.54, "end": 956.54, "text": "Boogie nights."}, {"start": 956.54, "end": 959.54, "text": "You're fat, Burt Reynolds, right?"}, {"start": 961.54, "end": 964.54, "text": "I'll take it."}, {"start": 971.54, "end": 972.8733333333333, "text": "Oh, man, you're late."}, {"start": 972.8733333333333, "end": 973.8257142857143, "text": "What'd they do?"}, {"start": 973.8257142857143, "end": 975.54, "text": "Tell me who they look like."}, {"start": 975.54, "end": 976.7291891891891, "text": "Doc, Doc, who's there?"}, {"start": 976.7291891891891, "end": 977.8643243243242, "text": "It's your femur bone."}, {"start": 977.8643243243242, "end": 978.9454054054053, "text": "He needs some money."}, {"start": 978.9454054054053, "end": 979.54, "text": "He's broke."}, {"start": 979.54, "end": 982.54, "text": "Oh, okay."}, {"start": 982.54, "end": 985.54, "text": "Well, after's the best medicine."}, {"start": 985.54, "end": 986.54, "text": "What are you doing?"}, {"start": 986.54, "end": 988.54, "text": "I'm challenging your entomological establishment, sir."}, {"start": 988.54, "end": 989.54, "text": "Not you."}, {"start": 989.54, "end": 992.54, "text": "So, we just spent our whole night paying off your debt."}, {"start": 995.454, "end": 997.454, "text": "And you're blowing money on a patch, Adams?"}, {"start": 997.454, "end": 998.6979024390243, "text": "It's two for one."}, {"start": 998.6979024390243, "end": 1000.454, "text": "We're doing Popeye next."}, {"start": 1000.454, "end": 1001.454, "text": "Ah, gah, gah, gah, gah."}, {"start": 1001.454, "end": 1003.454, "text": "Get him some spinach."}, {"start": 1004.454, "end": 1006.454, "text": "And olive oil."}, {"start": 1011.454, "end": 1013.454, "text": "Get out!"}, {"start": 1032.8319999999999, "end": 1034.8319999999999, "text": "Are you mad at me?"}, {"start": 1035.8319999999999, "end": 1036.8319999999999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1036.8319999999999, "end": 1037.8319999999999, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1037.8319999999999, "end": 1040.8319999999999, "text": "I was gonna go on the Dreamatorium and play Inspector Spacetime."}, {"start": 1040.8319999999999, "end": 1042.8319999999999, "text": "Have fun."}, {"start": 1047.8319999999999, "end": 1048.8319999999999, "text": "Abed."}, {"start": 1048.8319999999999, "end": 1050.8319999999999, "text": "Yeah?"}, {"start": 1050.8319999999999, "end": 1051.6012307692306, "text": "Come here."}, {"start": 1051.6012307692306, "end": 1052.8319999999999, "text": "I am mad at you."}, {"start": 1061.012, "end": 1062.247294117647, "text": "You said you weren't."}, {"start": 1062.247294117647, "end": 1063.012, "text": "We never lie."}, {"start": 1063.012, "end": 1064.012, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 1064.012, "end": 1064.48075, "text": "We made a deal."}, {"start": 1064.48075, "end": 1065.012, "text": "October 15, 2009."}, {"start": 1065.012, "end": 1066.012, "text": "Friends don't lie to each other."}, {"start": 1066.012, "end": 1067.512, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 1067.512, "end": 1069.012, "text": "I lied."}, {"start": 1069.012, "end": 1070.6821030927833, "text": "Because you don't like people who tell you what to do,"}, {"start": 1070.6821030927833, "end": 1072.012, "text": "and I don't want to be one of those people."}, {"start": 1072.012, "end": 1073.012, "text": "Then don't be."}, {"start": 1073.012, "end": 1073.5218039215686, "text": "I have to be."}, {"start": 1073.5218039215686, "end": 1075.4433725490196, "text": "You have to stop running celebrity impersonators."}, {"start": 1075.4433725490196, "end": 1077.012, "text": "Vinny was gonna break both of your legs."}, {"start": 1077.012, "end": 1079.012, "text": "I had to work really hard to help you."}, {"start": 1079.012, "end": 1080.012, "text": "But that's what you wanted to do."}, {"start": 1080.012, "end": 1082.012, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 1082.012, "end": 1084.012, "text": "But I can't do what I want to do?"}, {"start": 1084.012, "end": 1084.404857142857, "text": "That's not."}, {"start": 1084.404857142857, "end": 1085.012, "text": "Not all the time."}, {"start": 1085.012, "end": 1088.012, "text": "Sometimes you're just gonna have to trust that I know better about stuff."}, {"start": 1088.012, "end": 1089.012, "text": "I don't know if I can do that."}, {"start": 1089.012, "end": 1092.012, "text": "Then, I guess you're gonna have to trust that you're gonna have to trust me."}, {"start": 1094.9039999999998, "end": 1098.9039999999998, "text": "Well, I don't want to stop being your friend, so..."}, {"start": 1098.9039999999998, "end": 1101.9039999999998, "text": "I guess I'll let you tell me what to do sometimes."}, {"start": 1102.9039999999998, "end": 1104.9039999999998, "text": "Still best friends?"}, {"start": 1104.9039999999998, "end": 1106.9039999999998, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1107.9039999999998, "end": 1109.9039999999998, "text": "Still best friends."}, {"start": 1109.9039999999998, "end": 1110.9039999999998, "text": "Always."}, {"start": 1110.9039999999998, "end": 1111.9039999999998, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1111.9039999999998, "end": 1112.9039999999998, "text": "Cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 1112.9039999999998, "end": 1113.9039999999998, "text": "Still gonna go to the Dreamatorium?"}, {"start": 1113.9039999999998, "end": 1117.9039999999998, "text": "Oh, yeah, but I think I'm gonna play by myself right now, if that's okay."}, {"start": 1117.9039999999998, "end": 1118.9039999999998, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1118.9039999999998, "end": 1119.9039999999998, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1119.9039999999998, "end": 1121.9039999999998, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1126.9039999999998, "end": 1128.9039999999998, "text": "Deep breath, all through the greatest."}, {"start": 1128.9039999999998, "end": 1129.9039999999998, "text": "Whoo!"}, {"start": 1129.9039999999998, "end": 1131.9039999999998, "text": "Deep breath, all through the greatest."}, {"start": 1134.9039999999998, "end": 1136.9039999999998, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 1140.9039999999998, "end": 1141.9384827586205, "text": "Still, still, still."}, {"start": 1141.9384827586205, "end": 1143.9039999999998, "text": "Deep breath, all through the greatest."}, {"start": 1159.9039999999998, "end": 1160.9039999999998, "text": "You okay?"}, {"start": 1160.9039999999998, "end": 1161.1830697674416, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1161.1830697674416, "end": 1163.3226046511625, "text": "I ruined a bar mitzvah."}, {"start": 1163.3226046511625, "end": 1164.9039999999998, "text": "I'm a bad person."}, {"start": 1164.9039999999998, "end": 1166.5159402985073, "text": "What you're feeling is called shame."}, {"start": 1166.5159402985073, "end": 1167.9039999999998, "text": "It means you're getting better."}, {"start": 1167.9039999999998, "end": 1170.9039999999998, "text": "You're gonna be safe again once those pills were off."}, {"start": 1171.9039999999998, "end": 1174.9039999999998, "text": "Um, I was thinking..."}, {"start": 1174.9039999999998, "end": 1178.9039999999998, "text": "You know that person that you study for your psych class?"}, {"start": 1179.9039999999998, "end": 1181.9039999999998, "text": "Maybe that should be me."}, {"start": 1181.9039999999998, "end": 1182.3630163934424, "text": "No way."}, {"start": 1182.3630163934424, "end": 1185.9039999999998, "text": "You are way out of my league, diagnostically speaking."}, {"start": 1185.9039999999998, "end": 1189.258838709677, "text": "I'm gonna go with someone a little less complicated."}, {"start": 1189.258838709677, "end": 1189.9039999999998, "text": "Like Abed."}, {"start": 1197.9039999999998, "end": 1201.9039999999998, "text": "Hi, Abed."}, {"start": 1212.9039999999998, "end": 1213.9039999999998, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 1213.9039999999998, "end": 1215.9039999999998, "text": "Where's Troy?"}, {"start": 1215.9039999999998, "end": 1216.7928888888887, "text": "In the other room?"}, {"start": 1216.7928888888887, "end": 1217.3854814814813, "text": "That's okay."}, {"start": 1217.3854814814813, "end": 1219.9039999999998, "text": "There are many advantages of traveling by yourself."}, {"start": 1219.9039999999998, "end": 1223.9039999999998, "text": "You can drive faster, change direction, and the only pee breaks are yours."}, {"start": 1224.9039999999998, "end": 1226.142095238095, "text": "Are you real?"}, {"start": 1226.142095238095, "end": 1226.9039999999998, "text": "Are you?"}, {"start": 1227.9039999999998, "end": 1229.0092631578946, "text": "This is really crazy."}, {"start": 1229.0092631578946, "end": 1230.9039999999998, "text": "And inaccessible and maybe too dark."}, {"start": 1230.9039999999998, "end": 1232.9039999999998, "text": "Maybe to them, but not to us."}, {"start": 1233.9039999999998, "end": 1234.9039999999998, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1235.9039999999998, "end": 1237.5230476190475, "text": "Cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 1237.5230476190475, "end": 1237.9039999999998, "text": "Hot."}, {"start": 1237.9039999999998, "end": 1239.9039999999998, "text": "Hot, hot, hot."}, {"start": 1258.9039999999998, "end": 1261.9039999999998, "text": "Gentlemen, who's ready to Chang the world?"}]}